  'draft', 'foundation',
  'An 81-year-old woman presents after a fall at home, reporting light-headedness on standing up from her chair just before she fell. She takes bendroflumethiazide for hypertension and amlodipine. Lying blood pressure is 148/86 mmHg; on standing for one minute, blood pressure is 108/64 mmHg with associated dizziness.',
  'What is the most likely contributing cause of her fall?',
  array['postural hypotension','falls','antihypertensives']
),
