  'draft', 'foundation',
  'As part of a comprehensive geriatric assessment, an 80-year-old man is asked to rise from a chair without using his arms, walk three metres, turn around, walk back, and sit down again, while being timed.',
  'What is this assessment tool designed to evaluate?',
  array['Timed Up and Go','gait and balance assessment']
),
