  'draft', 'advanced',
  'An 85-year-old woman with multiple comorbidities is assessed using the Clinical Frailty Scale prior to a decision about escalation of care for a new acute illness. She requires help with all outdoor activities and housework, but is independent with personal care; she describes previous slowing up and needing more help in the last year.',
  'Which Clinical Frailty Scale category best fits this description?',
  array['Clinical Frailty Scale','frailty assessment']
),
