  'draft', 'foundation',
  'A 68-year-old postmenopausal woman presents with sudden-onset thoracic back pain after bending to pick up a light shopping bag. She has no history of trauma. Plain radiograph confirms a wedge compression fracture of T12. She has no other significant medical history and takes no regular medications.',
  'What is the most appropriate next investigation?',
  array['fragility fracture','DEXA','osteoporosis']
),
