  'draft', 'core',
  'A 72-year-old woman is assessed after a DEXA scan shows a T-score of -2.0 at the femoral neck. She has no prior fractures but has a history of her mother sustaining a hip fracture, and she drinks alcohol above recommended limits. Her clinician is deciding whether she requires treatment for osteoporosis prevention.',
  'What is the most appropriate next step in her risk assessment?',
  array['FRAX','fracture risk assessment','osteopenia']
),
