  'draft', 'foundation',
  'A 75-year-old woman is prescribed oral alendronic acid for osteoporosis following a wrist fracture. She asks how she should take the tablet to reduce the risk of side effects.',
  'What is the most appropriate advice regarding administration of this medication?',
  array['bisphosphonates','alendronate','medication counselling']
),
