  'draft', 'foundation',
  'An 85-year-old woman is brought to the emergency department after a fall at home, with severe left hip pain and inability to weight-bear. On examination, the left leg is shortened and externally rotated. She has known osteoporosis. X-ray confirms a displaced intracapsular fracture of the left femoral neck.',
  'What is the most appropriate definitive management?',
  array['hip fracture','surgical management']
),
