  'draft', 'core',
  'A 79-year-old man with osteoporosis and stage 4 chronic kidney disease (eGFR 22 mL/min/1.73m2) sustains a further vertebral fragility fracture despite adherence to oral bisphosphonate therapy. His clinician is considering an alternative treatment.',
  'Which of the following is most appropriate to consider, given his renal function?',
  array['denosumab','renal impairment','osteoporosis treatment']
),
