  'draft', 'advanced',
  'A 74-year-old woman has been on subcutaneous denosumab injections every six months for osteoporosis for the past three years. She misses her most recent scheduled injection by several months and asks her GP whether this matters.',
  'What is the most important safety information to give her?',
  array['denosumab discontinuation','rebound fracture risk']
),
