  'draft', 'core',
  'A 70-year-old woman presents with diffuse bone pain and proximal muscle weakness. Blood tests show low serum calcium, low phosphate, low 25-hydroxyvitamin D, and markedly raised alkaline phosphatase. A DEXA scan shows reduced bone mineral density.',
