  'draft', 'core',
  'A 79-year-old woman with atrial fibrillation, on digoxin for rate control, develops an acute kidney injury during an admission for a chest infection, with eGFR falling from 60 to 25 mL/min/1.73m2. She reports new nausea, anorexia and visual disturbance with yellow-tinged vision.',
  'What is the most likely explanation for her new symptoms?',
  array['digoxin toxicity','renal impairment']
),
