  'draft', 'foundation',
  'A 90-year-old woman with advanced dementia and limited life expectancy is reviewed by her GP. Her medication list includes a statin for primary cardiovascular prevention, a bisphosphonate, and several other long-term preventive medications, none of which are providing symptomatic benefit.',
