  'draft', 'core',
  'An 85-year-old man with chronic osteoarthritis pain has been taking regular co-codamol (containing codeine) for several months. He now reports persistent constipation with straining and infrequent, hard stool, despite good oral fluid intake, and one episode of overflow diarrhoea.',
