  'draft', 'foundation',
  'A 78-year-old woman is prescribed temazepam by her GP for insomnia related to recent bereavement. Two weeks later she is brought to the emergency department after a fall at home, and her family report she has seemed more drowsy and unsteady on her feet since starting the new tablet.',
  'What is the most likely contributing factor to her fall?',
  array['benzodiazepines','sedative-related falls']
),
